FO - Product page - Product page : Display tag products (New, On sale, Pack&hellip;) Details Component : Core Status : Automated Scenario : https://prestashop-jira.atlassian.net/browse/TEST-7943 Test : https://github.com/PrestaShop/PrestaShop/tree/develop/tests/UI/campaigns/functional/FO/classic/09_productPage/02_productPage/12_displayTag.ts Steps Step Description Expected result Go to BO &gt; Catalog &gt; Product You should have all your product displayed on the BO * Clic on &ldquo;Add new product&rdquo;
* Clic on &ldquo;Pack of product&rdquo;
* Clic on &ldquo;Add new product&rdquo; * A modal should be displayed to choose the correct type of product * The description of the product&rsquo;s type change

